@startuml
title Scoped FLT Holes: Positive Fill and Negative Capture
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Hole declaration\nh : (Delta_h |- Sort)\nstable HoleId" as Hole #FEF3C7
rectangle "Occurrence h[sigma]\nexplicit reindexing" as Occ #E0E7FF
rectangle "Construction right\npositive substitution" as Fill #DBEAFE
rectangle "Match right\nnegative capture" as Capture #EDE9FE
rectangle "Same-handle scoped value\nor verified morphism" as Bound #DCFCE7
rectangle "Typed capture environment\ncommitted atomically" as Matched #A7F3D0

Hole --> Occ : scope occurrence
Occ --> Fill : term position
Occ --> Capture : pattern position
Fill --> Bound : capture-avoiding Kleisli fill
Capture --> Matched : Miller/nominal fragment

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Declared structural hole |
  |<#E0E7FF> | Scoped occurrence |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Construction-side operation |
  |<#EDE9FE> | Pattern-side operation |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Scoped FLT value |
  |<#A7F3D0> | Atomic capture gate |
endlegend
@enduml
